  "title": "各取所需",
  "storyCode": "4-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c7a2e1b57c8e2bcd03721d7c37e03667f826786a53f607f1cb3d79f02e557c0a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "為了攀爬個觀測點，都要解決那麼多整合運動......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "咦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那個......是陳長官嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（怎麼會有這麼多屍體......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（這麼多整合運動......全都是陳長官一個人打倒的嗎？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "是你們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我衝動了。抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我可能中了敵人的陷阱......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不......沒事，沒有偏離計畫太多，只是————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "之前，出現的是......塔露拉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......不。無所謂了。應該是我的錯覺，這裡無論如何也不像有那個人在的狀況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "還是，要以任務優先。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......如果不是我來帶隊，近衛局將很難開展搜查任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "尤其是現在的情況......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "比我預想更複雜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "依照現狀，獨自深入的代價太大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官，羅德島也希望你能夠暫時返回近衛局隊伍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這裡畢竟是天災殘留的源石叢多生地段，對於健康人而言是很不利的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "事先準備的防護消耗品也不一定能維持很久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "保護龍門，優先清理龍門的威脅，當然是我們的任務——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但在我們來到這裡的理由中，最重要的那個，是解救羅德島的成員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "羅德島不會放棄任何一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因此，羅德島的作戰方針也不會改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我會帶隊與你們會合——在條件允許的情況下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官！羅德島可以讓一支小隊護送你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......陳長官，真要強呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯？博士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......沒關係的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我知道......羅德島又要孤軍奮戰了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但現在可不是垂頭喪氣的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "畢竟，潔西卡她們還在等著我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
